# Auto-generated docs/TOOLS.md is compared byte-exact against the
# output of `scripts/gen_tools_doc.py` (which always emits LF).  On
# Windows with `core.autocrlf=true` (the LAB + self-hosted runner
# default), git would otherwise convert LF -> CRLF on checkout, then
# the drift gate sees CRLF on disk vs LF from render() and fails
# even though the logical content is identical.  Lock to LF.
docs/TOOLS.md text eol=lf
